Provenance of the bundled components
==============================================================================

This repository was assembled by merging four previously separate projects.
Each of them was originally published by the same copyright holder under the
MIT License.

  runtime/             runc-edge-api
                       upstream: https://github.com/http418imateapot/runc-edge-api
                       original license: MIT

  autoscale/           plc-ebpf-autoscaler
                       upstream: https://github.com/http418imateapot/plc-ebpf-autoscaler
                       original license: MIT

  edgeconf/core/       robust-binary-config
                       upstream: https://github.com/http418imateapot/robust-binary-config
                       original license: MIT

  edgeconf/patterns/   robust-config-exchange
                       upstream: https://github.com/http418imateapot/robust-config-exchange
                       original license: MIT

==============================================================================
Third-party dependencies
==============================================================================

No third-party source code is vendored in this repository. Components declare
their runtime dependencies through pyproject.toml, requirements.txt, Makefile
and CMakeLists.txt; those dependencies remain under their own license terms.
See autoscale/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the autoscale component's dependency
inventory.
